        ],
        "@id": "prototype:de1fcd75-bbe2-4782-a37e-d0aa227bcb47",
        "rdfs:label": "DoorDash",
        "rdfs:comment": "DoorDash, Inc. is an American company operating online food ordering and food delivery. It trades under the symbol DASH. With a 56% market share, DoorDash is the largest food delivery platform in the United States. It also has a 60% market share in the convenience delivery category. As of December 31, 2020, the platform was used by 450,000 merchants, 20 million consumers, and had over one million delivery couriers.",
